      "hash": "4def77f9388809f53620144510fcc4b6f08662617bcc06a15abc618242e6544c"
    },
    {
      "id": "d47b73cab9cdcdb83f1eede11e5a23b39277cdeccd3854f91288cae0ee916875",
      "text": "Topics",
      "hash": "e22820fcf5cd90e3fdd99a7569e0ee2f30eb7ebadfb2fe4d159b30c166ff81b7"
    },
    {
      "id": "331ef46705906c81c6e9240146181842461f47462ede96a5e337945ac258d59f",
      "text": "The Model",
      "hash": "1954409637324f1c3f2cab102211fd161a6cd1c270252fc2e1297a69ab9a446b"
    },
    {
      "id": "0baf33fcc59a38f4b5f0de2265460bb00a84b7aa1526451a95839917135c4419",
      "text": "Training",
      "hash": "36a798e3f39239ccdec697ee348d2ce0a7b8d2d9087940496e2ca5d0853399f2"
    },
    {
      "id": "6dd004201c61a78ef1c36fa90c74bcb902f88ae63b9dfaf96945a5b99ddc7b07",
      "text": "The process that sets a model's parameters by exposing it to vast amounts of text and adjusting to improve next-token prediction.",
      "hash": "7484df838cffa2dcbb4cde1cb5fbb1cbc9431c4a4fd049fce8941b91edec474a"
    },
    {
      "id": "72ce2aca5e70be9caca053e25e2a6581f8395ea56acbd4d52c9d559992c3ff4a",
      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "b8c3c10f7fba1cb8b18bac8a5c6fa82c56ff4328e3092930bc01a7aa80501c6f",
      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "86601e73e030ce9c7bbfe0267fa2c39c489a1283a87685a77e06b9c36c094838",
      "text": "The process that sets a",
      "hash": "9d4e15f0f4a55f256b1b8b40a73a9767e3a3eae67d70d89ca6bc9bf81cb58fcf"
    },
    {
      "id": "ff735681b612299e927b1cc53f5e3f98e3b0b047a478c75d00e7cd4718ad786a",
      "text": "'s",
      "hash": "edc00d4db80ddc3e91783b63ae5fbcdfd204de983c650e9587785a40271c8f3c"
    },
    {
      "id": "4e4c25dab1c95450ab99c3760a3542dc2f050f8a1ee2db1f1900107497ed5bc8",
      "text": ", by exposing it to vast amounts of text and adjusting parameters to improve",
      "hash": "cbc1f7326ddf4950769f56c0e20a055c498bda4d0c326937c6685f7c15d9f718"
    },
    {
      "id": "d44bdf2d5ce09ca774db554405e8fb0486fa738b66af06bb87d7dcfca3c54228",
      "text": "next-token prediction",
      "hash": "8203f57feb66cc8742e92d9fe92000a0898a09207548cb184413f5f2607f0f54"
    },
    {
      "id": "ed8f58ac401532dfc3d013dfa2a705dac3f929182e24083791a0b47aa58d221d",
      "text": ". A one-time, expensive process done by the",
      "hash": "934a89a904fb51f20b514eba3b8fde18c35011b38c7740d6ae8d3e46b046201f"
    },
    {
      "id": "6caede7844ba1400943d47e9656ecccd008782dd01c643ea350154de113d9648",
      "text": "model provider",
      "hash": "246b63adac7f39ba5bb454147f02345525eb942a929d0640282e7d17d229e313"
    },
    {
      "id": "19eab152bc12d7498ba6f8753eb7900773e8f78b899e2ad2d4e74d60c37a51c2",
      "text": ". Encompasses both pre-training (the bulk run) and post-training (later refinements like instruction-following and safety); the distinction doesn't matter at this glossary's level.",
      "hash": "afce584b245f6ff4887d7c1b94ff02e0200007917b45d7dce9472aa2591c770f"
    },
    {
      "id": "4afe05dd5c4970563bf3eede0f248ed7ea2cb004cab8c368c5e4e00ade8fc4a7",
      "text": "The mechanism is repetition at scale: show the model a stretch of text, have it predict the next",
      "hash": "70d9de20fc7d3591dd0718bdefbd13160e4d283ad4d46dabfed225f6cf9037ee"
    },
    {
      "id": "6cbb2399cf76fbb19ac127f92ca231c786a97a43fe83655decdaa2da7075d6de",
      "text": ", nudge the parameters toward whatever the actual next token was, and repeat across trillions of tokens. Nothing is stored as facts or rules — everything the model \"knows\" is a side effect of getting better at prediction, compressed into the parameters as",
      "hash": "693bb850469eef48dd22a8fd3c004b16a9caba512e6cd735b09f65bc627a14f5"
    },
    {
      "id": "ababeb273550b69e6bf0e2ba58249609db670042262362aab038c8540d216d23",
      "text": "parametric knowledge",
      "hash": "af45e8f3199438ecb8e32a5842d362c9e1486e34f1b2d9374b547824e0ceb837"
    },
    {
      "id": "e91757f47592391bd4fd507a60205ed6f87147926cdd04deb3e35a105a3148eb",
      "text": "Two consequences matter day to day. Training ends at a point in time, so the model has a",
      "hash": "9943167995c2918e2e6445caa5872dcdae1563e66bd1372956eaf0b2e3852adf"
    },
    {
      "id": "773eb8e4eee592f6e2feedece379abbcb8901c89117d832c5d506c391d8290d2",
      "text": "knowledge cutoff",
      "hash": "46f1820f6339cd5450653d0018ffb90af1d929a074ed2e211dfa39e52b7cc408"
    },
    {
      "id": "24f26194665908921dbe950a452de18a88dcbd592a9fac13677887ec74356b18",
      "text": "— it hasn't seen the library version you upgraded to last month. And training is not something you can do: when the model doesn't know your codebase, your conventions, or your internal APIs, the fix is never \"teach the model\" — it's putting that material into",
      "hash": "7343292fbdbd09a3286124fdc9ab6be46f7af9ea30843c77fe42aa5d75d4e2d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "c3d4cf76571225c283a765240d35c522cca68ec06e8a80eec241a154bd9ac239",
      "text": ", the one input you control.",
      "hash": "65edbea9ae3ced88492bfb08aeb76de7bca5c46855e137638b0eaaacf93c2262"
    },
    {
      "id": "128123ab9e9a86ef1095bce288dc6dabf0da88e8e3396d75d27fce6c09549c42",
      "text": "Usage:",
      "hash": "2bad3eeaf33caffe3bc9b482b4934ed19eb4ec3614c12373e1a5c5f8948217da"
    },
    {
      "id": "db46eebbb41e8c7c0b29a361c9c1d68b3dcd04438b0bb12032f7b07cf3853c70",
      "text": "\"Can we get it to know our internal API?\"",
      "hash": "4980a7c5f01e761b7c8573d1bac1eeb20013541aacc3f6797b01ab0ca3834ed1"
    },
    {
      "id": "461eee818e328033b73f7e92b0515cc0c52138058d129bb41ef50e36067fd192",
      "text": "\"Not via training — that's a months-long process by the model provider. Load the API docs into context instead, that's the lever you actually have.\"",
      "hash": "9a8ce2e9b543cd4e2102e48077a902980bb85e0c0bc87b294a55594c5dbed899"
    },
    {
      "id": "8c80814f351ef1a1a4c4e2c22ff824e79a636d1fc72b28161238d1cb7176b7ab",
      "text": "Previous term",
      "hash": "735604aff9e8f2192b83df4905cfc8e395613e0ce05f8ca85a1d2d1d44fd59f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "0f0140adc20815bffab3bccd7c0a5be827257680c6ae15a54b9e809fdbf65202",
      "text": "Parameters",
      "hash": "e68b36b17cbd990802f57741cb75cf3a73fa66a61999b0cd70e3cf7d26cfb25f"
    },
    {
      "id": "ad51d4fabde7011a7a7a6ee2dd90ba2ca13f071253c508a4ebdcd4bcd515186a",
      "text": "Next term",
      "hash": "5219c7ebdc0e098aa6db6f09e405c1b17ab75f1082862906a872e10a16818f9e"
    },
    {
      "id": "b3d5f4214eed6ab68ae13956957262723ea900c6fa81c931e122919b1277f573",
      "text": "Inference",
      "hash": "ae5b8a4c6ac9aa79b9fa5676a05734984afeba28277a24d2f3baffa9354ccc7f"
    },
    {
      "id": "a09c14eb527e1218931d8216d4ba6032f25aefbdd3113a00430324475e8afa55",
      "text": "Want more than vocabulary?",
      "hash": "5d5500a083006a1606e84a03c018904d01364631c6baea4c7a3f8f3f62bf94dc"
    },
    {
      "id": "111d6842477de12b1c8a0cd622824d07741be6dd824e7a7e645e633f9558e1e3",
      "text": "Join AI Hero for practical skills, thinking on AI engineering, and resources that keep you ahead of the curve.",
      "hash": "a082f7147e30da6afe92268d5668a530edfff13e64934f8f63f22c098db86133"
    },
    {
